{"unit_id":"tag:06F7:prose-0001","translation":"\n\n<STRUCT_0001>\n令<MATH_0001>为态射（morphisms）的一个性质，这些态射属于代数空间（algebraic spaces）。“<MATH_0002>关于源和目标是光滑（smooth）局部的”这句话具有直观的含义。然而，这个概念与要求<MATH_0003>同时关于源是光滑（smooth）局部的、关于目标是光滑（smooth）局部的并不相同。我们已在《下降（Descent）》第<REF_0001>节中十分详细地讨论过一个类似的现象（对于平展（<ACCENT_0001>tale）拓扑（topology）和概形（schemes）的范畴（category）而言）（要快速了解概况，可看《下降（Descent）》注记<REF_0002>）。不过，光滑（smooth）情形和平展（<ACCENT_0002>tale）拓扑（topology）情形之间有一个重要区别。为了解这一点，我们建议读者思考《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0003>和引理<REF_0004>之间的区别，以及《下降（Descent）》引理<REF_0005>和引理<REF_0006>之间的区别。也就是说，在平展（<ACCENT_0003>tale）情形中，目标的平展（<ACCENT_0004>tale）“覆盖（covering）”的选择无关紧要，而在光滑（smooth）情形中则不然。\n\n","allowed_english":[],"term_occurrences":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑"}],"unknown_terms":[{"source_term":"morphisms","target_term":"态射","context":"性质的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"algebraic spaces","target_term":"代数空间","context":"对象类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"smooth","target_term":"光滑","context":"局部性；待决。"},{"source_term":"Descent","target_term":"下降","context":"引用章名；待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0001>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"拓扑类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"topology","target_term":"拓扑","context":"局部性环境；待决。"},{"source_term":"schemes","target_term":"概形","context":"比较的对象；待决。"},{"source_term":"category","target_term":"范畴","context":"比较的范畴；待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0002>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"第二处拓扑类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0003>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"平展情形；待决。"},{"source_term":"<ACCENT_0004>tale","target_term":"平展","context":"覆盖类型；待决。"},{"source_term":"covering","target_term":"覆盖","context":"目标的覆盖；待决。"}],"notes":[]}
